### Test Admin Sales Route
GET http://localhost:3000/api/sales/admin/all
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

### Test Admin Sales with Filters
GET http://localhost:3000/api/sales/admin/all?startDate=2024-01-01&endDate=2024-12-31&cashierId=EMPLOYEE_ID&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

### Test Cashier My Sales Route
GET http://localhost:3000/api/sales/my-sales
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_CASHIER_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

### Test Cashier My Sales with Date Filter
GET http://localhost:3000/api/sales/my-sales?startDate=2024-01-01&endDate=2024-12-31&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_CASHIER_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json
